### getAll
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/users
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### getById
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/users/1
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### getById (uno que no existe)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/users/300

### Nuevo usuario (contraseña User1)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/users
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "nombre": "Carlos",
  "apellidos": "Carlos User",
  "username": "carlos",
  "password": "$2a$12$RUq2ScW1Kiizu5K4gKoK4OTz80.DWaruhdyfi2lZCB.KeuXTBh0S.",
  "email": "carlos@prueba.net",
  "roles": [
    "USER"
  ]
}

### Actualiza tarjeta
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/v1/users/5
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Carlos",
  "apellidos": "Carlos User",
  "username": "carlos",
  "password": "$2a$12$RUq2ScW1Kiizu5K4gKoK4OTz80.DWaruhdyfi2lZCB.KeuXTBh0S.",
  "email": "carlos@hotmail.com",
  "roles": [
    "USER"
  ]
}

### Delete tarjeta
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/v1/users/5
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

